  "title": "Orange Pie II",
  "description": "Softened cream cheese, sweetened condensed milk, and dry orange drink mix are beaten in a large bowl until combined. The filling is poured into a graham cracker crust and chilled for an hour. A snap to make and so refreshing, this creamy pie becomes even better with whipped topping and mandarin oranges.",
